// Title: Security Software Discovery - MacOs
// ID: 0ed75b9c-c73b-424d-9e7d-496cd565fbe0
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Daniil Yugoslavskiy, oscd.community
// Date: 2020-10-19
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1518.001
// Description: Detects usage of system utilities (only grep for now) to discover security software discovery
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

_sourceCategory=* | where ((Image = "/usr/bin/grep") and (((CommandLine matches "*nessusd*" or CommandLine matches "*santad*" or CommandLine matches "*CbDefense*" or CommandLine matches "*falcond*" or CommandLine matches "*td-agent*" or CommandLine matches "*packetbeat*" or CommandLine matches "*filebeat*" or CommandLine matches "*auditbeat*" or CommandLine matches "*osqueryd*" or CommandLine matches "*BlockBlock*" or CommandLine matches "*LuLu*")) or ((CommandLine matches "*Little*" and CommandLine matches "*Snitch*"))))
